# File: scripts/__tests__/
# Generated from: specs/556-close-the-known-gaps-left-by-parallel-delivery-551-and-the-controller-wait-fix-550/requirements.md
Feature: Close the known gaps left by parallel delivery and the controller wait fix

  @SCN001
  Scenario: A spec published on the remote default branch is found from a stale checkout
    Given an approved spec merged on the remote default branch
    And a primary checkout that lacks it and cannot be fast-forwarded
    When execute starts the issue
    Then the spec check finds the spec on the fetched remote default branch and the start proceeds

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Spec worktrees run no setup or teardown
    Given a manifest that declares worktree setup and teardown
    When a spec worktree is created and removed
    Then neither command runs, while an issue worktree still runs both

  @SCN003
  Scenario: A live lock holder's lock is never broken on age
    Given a lock held by a live process on this host for longer than the stale age
    When another process waits on it
    Then the lock is not broken and the wait fails shared_state_locked at its deadline
    And a lock held by a dead process is broken at once

  @SCN004
  Scenario: A changelog-only queue conflict keeps the branch's own entries
    Given a queue-head branch with its own Unreleased bullet and a default branch that conflicts only in VERSION and CHANGELOG.md
    When the controller integrates the default branch
    Then the resolved changelog holds the default branch's content and the branch bullet under its category

  @SCN005
  Scenario: A stopped worker behind its waiting marker is noticed at once
    Given a settled worker behind its waiting marker
    When its status becomes failed or killed with no new activity
    Then the wait ends before the resume bound and the stage ends as process_lost

  @SCN006
  Scenario: Check-ins continue while a settled worker waits behind its marker
    Given a settled worker waiting behind its marker past the check-in interval
    When the controller supervises it
    Then check-in reports name the waiting command
